### Problem 21

**Find the error.** Jason and Daniela are solving a system of equations. Is either of them correct? Explain your reasoning.

The following columns transcribe the complete work that the worksheet gives to the learner.

#### Jason

`2r + 7t = 11`

`r - 9t = -7`

`2r + 7t = 11`

`(-) 2r - 18t = -14`

`25t = 25`

`t = 1`

`2r + 7t = 11`

`2r + 7(1) = 11`

`2r + 7 = 11`

`2r = 4`

`2r / 2 = 4 / 2`

`r = 2`

The solution is `(2, 1)`.

#### Daniela

`2r + 7t = 11`

`(-) r - 9t = -7`

`r = 18`

`2r + 7t = 11`

`2(18) + 7t = 11`

`36 + 7t = 11`

`7t = -25`

`7t / 7 = 25 / 7`

`t = -3.6`

The solution is `(18, -3.6)`.

